# 📄 Changelog

All notable changes to **OU Insight Hub** will be documented in this file.

The project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/) and follows the [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/) format.

---

## [1.0.0] - 2025-04-26

### Added
- Initialized the **OU Insight Hub** project (Backend: Express.js, Prisma, MongoDB; Frontend: Next.js, React, TailwindCSS).
- Implemented landing pages: Home, Events, and News.
- Integrated Google and Facebook authentication.
- Enabled users to create event/news posts pending admin approval.
- Developed Admin Dashboard for managing user submissions.
- Added user role and admin role management.
- Implemented "Save Post" feature for users.
- Added notification system for approved posts.

### Changed
- Optimized page load speed with lazy loading for images and data preloading strategies.
- Standardized API structure between frontend and backend following RESTful best practices.

### Fixed
- Resolved login failure issues caused by temporary connection loss.
- Fixed mobile responsiveness issues on small screen devices.

---

## [1.1.0] - Upcoming

### Added
- Nested comment system (threaded comments) for event posts.
- User and post statistics dashboard for admin management.
- Real-time notification system using Socket.IO.
- Light and dark theme toggle for the entire platform.
- Post search functionality by keywords.

---

> 📢 **Note:**  
> This changelog will be updated regularly to reflect all ongoing improvements, fixes, and new features as OU Insight Hub evolves.

